. Through the children's collaborative collection of flowers and the final shared feast, students learn the values of teamwork, mutual respect, and sharing.\n\nEmpathy and Generosity: The reciprocal relationship between the children (who bring blessings) and the elders (who give gifts) teaches students the importance of hospitality, gratitude, and respecting community relationships.	{}	t	\N	\N	2026-06-18 14:19:11.387147	2026-06-18 14:19:11.387147
